    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels so selfish to keep dragging this out. like, what if the most unselfish thing i could actually do is just stop being an obstacle? if i weren't here, she could finally just breathe and live her own life without having to watch me struggle every second. it feels like it would be a relief for her, even if it's sad for a bit. it feels like the only way i can actually be helpful to her now.",
